{"pageid": 298, "title": "Something Is Killing the Children 22", "revid": 2756, "categories": ["Comics", "Something Is Killing the Children comics"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\">Something Is Killing the Children #22</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/c/c7/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_22_Cover.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20230226173550\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 22 Cover\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/c/c7/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_22_Cover.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20230226173550\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/c/c7/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_22_Cover.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20230226173550 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/c/c7/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_22_Cover.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20230226173550 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Something Is Killing the Children 22 Cover\" width=\"270\" height=\"415\" data-image-key=\"Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_22_Cover.jpg\" data-image-name=\"Something Is Killing the Children 22 Cover.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Information</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"writer\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Written by</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/James_Tynion_IV\" title=\"James Tynion IV\">James Tynion IV</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"illustration\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Illustrated by</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Werther_Dell%27Edera\" title=\"Werther Dell&#39;Edera\">Werther Dell'Edera</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"release_date\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Release date</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">April 27, 2022</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Chronology</caption>\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_21\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 21\">Something Is Killing the Children #21</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_23\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 23\">Something Is Killing the Children #23</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #22</b> is a horror comic from <a href=\"/wiki/James_Tynion_IV\" title=\"James Tynion IV\">James Tynion IV</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Werther_Dell%27Edera\" title=\"Werther Dell&#39;Edera\">Werther Dell'Edera</a> that was published on April 27, 2022 by <a href=\"/wiki/Boom!_Studios\" title=\"Boom! Studios\">Boom! Studios</a>. It is the twenty-second issue in the <i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something Is Killing the Children</a></i> comic series.\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Synopsis\">Synopsis</span></h2>\n<p>Outside London, the shadowy figure on <a href=\"/wiki/Erica_Slaughter\" title=\"Erica Slaughter\">Erica</a>'s trail relays information to their enigmatic superior about the rogue agent in the <a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Slaughter\" title=\"House of Slaughter\">House of Slaughter</a>. Meanwhile, a town finds itself in the clutches of an elusive serial killer, and the only living witness to the crimes is a frightened child. Erica investigates the grisly scene of the most recent murder, ignorant of the hostile forces drawing in around her...\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Plot\">Plot</span></h2>\n<p>In England, <a href=\"/wiki/Charlotte_Cutter\" title=\"Charlotte Cutter\">Charlotte Cutter</a> sits contentedly among a bloody scene, where she'd killed a monster and multiple victims, including children, and pinned their eyes open. She makes her and her doll tea as <a href=\"/wiki/Albie_Cutter\" title=\"Albie Cutter\">Albie Cutter</a> arrives and tells her that the <a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Slaughter\" title=\"House of Slaughter\">House of Slaughter</a> has requested her services in Chicago to kill <a href=\"/wiki/Erica_Slaughter\" title=\"Erica Slaughter\">Erica Slaughter</a>.\n</p><p>In <span class=\"new\" title=\"Tribulation (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVHJpYnVsYXRpb24/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Tribulation</span>, <a href=\"/wiki/Gabi_Lopez\" title=\"Gabi Lopez\">Gabi Lopez</a> hesitantly asks Erica if she's police or a lawyer. The angry girl says that she saw somebody killing her sister, and that maybe she'll tell people it was Erica if the woman doesn't leave her alone. Erica tells her that she knows Gabi saw something supernatural, and that she's afraid she's going to be called crazy for it. She asks for Gabi to tell her about the monster that killed her family, because she kills monsters. Defiant, Gabi enters <span class=\"new\" title=\"The Luck of the Irish (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVGhlX0x1Y2tfb2ZfdGhlX0lyaXNoP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">The Luck of the Irish</span> and shouts that a pedophile is trying to pick her up in the parking lot. <a href=\"/wiki/Riqui\" title=\"Riqui\">Riqui</a> demands that Gabi show her the person outside, but in the back alley, Erica is already gone. Riqui tries to tell the young girl that she doesn't have to pretend to be okay, but Gabi once again lashes out, saying that just because Riqui wanted to fuck her dead aunt doesn't make her family.\n</p><p>At the police station, <a href=\"/wiki/Thomas_Carter\" title=\"Thomas Carter\">Thomas Carter</a> spots Erica and wonders who she is. He asks his deputy, <span class=\"new\" title=\"Bill Ramirez (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQmlsbF9SYW1pcmV6P2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Bill Ramirez</span>, if the state has finally called them back, to which they haven't. He laments not moving to Santa Fe, and says that he's going to drive to district headquarters to ask about what's happening. \n</p><p>Riqui sets up Gabi on her couch, and tells her about her and Gabi's aunt used to send each other messages in morse code through the windows. Gabi tries to sleep, but spots Erica sneaking into her house, and shouts for Riqui. At the Lopez crime scene, Erica talks to <a href=\"/wiki/Octo\" title=\"Octo\">Octo</a>, who says that it's not an <a href=\"/wiki/Oscuratype\" title=\"Oscuratype\">Oscuratype</a>, as it's heating its meals in warm water. A little perturbed at the idea she'll be facing a <a href=\"/wiki/Duplicitype\" title=\"Duplicitype\">Doppelganger Duplicitype</a>, Erica is then found by Officer <span class=\"new\" title=\"Benji (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQmVuamk/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Benji</span> and brought to the police station. As he takes her away, they leave Octo behind near the pool. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Characters\">Characters</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"The_Order_of_St._George\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Order_of_St._George\" title=\"The Order of St. George\">The Order of St. George</a></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Albie_Cutter\" title=\"Albie Cutter\">Albie Cutter</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Charlotte_Cutter\" title=\"Charlotte Cutter\">Charlotte Cutter</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Erica_Slaughter\" title=\"Erica Slaughter\">Erica Slaughter</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Tribulation\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Tribulation (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVHJpYnVsYXRpb24/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Tribulation</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Benji (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQmVuamk/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Benji</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Thomas_Carter\" title=\"Thomas Carter\">Thomas Carter</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Gabi_Lopez\" title=\"Gabi Lopez\">Gabi Lopez</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Bill Ramirez (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQmlsbF9SYW1pcmV6P2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Bill Ramirez</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Riqui\" title=\"Riqui\">Riqui</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Monsters\"><a href=\"/wiki/Monsters\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Monsters\">Monsters</a></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Totems\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Totems\">Totems</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Dolly\" title=\"Dolly\">Dolly</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Octo\" title=\"Octo\">Octo</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Erica Duplicitype (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvRXJpY2FfRHVwbGljaXR5cGU/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Tribulation Duplicitype</span></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"f9f75a3f223c4e86570bf1799ae7f739\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_22_Cover-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:184px; width:120px; top:0.5px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_22_Cover.jpg\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 22 Cover.jpg (1.01 MB)\" style=\"height:184px; width:120px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/c/c7/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_22_Cover.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/120?cb=20230226173550\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 22 Cover.jpg (1.01 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Something Is Killing the Children #22 cover by Werther Dell&#039;Edera\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Something Is Killing the Children 22 Cover.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_22_Cover.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"&lt;i&gt;Something Is Killing the Children&lt;/i&gt; #22 cover by Werther Dell&#039;Edera\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64